  "description": "500 years ago, Chase Elkin sealed the Dragon of Chaos, Kelgrave, and became immortal. Now living a leisurely life, his world is turned upside down when the dragon-cursed Emperor Cyril appears before him. Smitten at first sight by Cyril’s striking beauty, Chase is determined to help break the curse. Together, they embark on a perilous journey to the imperial palace.\nBut there’s a twist! To prevent the curse from progressing, Chase must continue to kiss Cyril, leading to many awkward yet tender moments. What adventures will this bashful warrior and the handsome, irritable emperor face as they navigate their way to the imperial palace?\n\nAmidst blushes and stolen glances, Chase’s feelings for Cyril grow stronger. Their journey is filled with magical challenges, dark forces, and the constant need to stay close, which is both a blessing and a curse. Will their budding romance survive the dangers ahead? \n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
